      "refersTo": "pricing-card",
      "description": "Approved planned Pro presentation; disabled purchase action and expandable source-backed details.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-pricing-root\"><article class=\"ds-price-plan\" aria-label=\"Pro plan\"><div class=\"ds-price-heading\"><h2>Pro</h2><span class=\"ds-price-badge\">Planned</span></div><p class=\"ds-price-description\">For regular professional design work.</p><div class=\"ds-price-amount\"><strong>$20</strong><span>/ month</span></div><p class=\"ds-price-note\">Planned monthly price · USD</p><dl class=\"ds-price-usage\"><div><dt>Usage level</dt><dd>Higher <span>· planned</span></dd></div><div><dt>Account</dt><dd>Individual</dd></div></dl><button class=\"ds-price-soon\" disabled aria-label=\"Pro is coming soon\">Coming soon</button><details class=\"ds-price-details\"><summary><span>Plan details</span><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></summary><div><p class=\"ds-price-feature-label\">Planned for Pro</p><p class=\"ds-price-feature\">Higher usage allowance for professional work</p><p class=\"ds-price-approval\">Revit changes require a connected model and explicit approval on every plan.</p></div></details></article></div>",
      "css": ".ds-pricing-root{container-type:inline-size;width:100%;color:var(--foreground,#e8e8e9);font-family:var(--font-sans,'Inter Variable',Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}.ds-price-plan{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;padding:24px;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--foreground,#e8e8e9) 72%,var(--border,#6f6f70));border-radius:10px;background:var(--secondary,#252527)}.ds-price-heading{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.ds-price-heading h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}.ds-price-badge{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;border:1px solid var(--border,#6f6f70);border-radius:5px;padding:3px 7px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6);white-space:nowrap}.ds-price-description{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6);min-height:40px;max-width:27ch;margin:13px 0 24px}.ds-price-amount{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:baseline;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-price-amount strong{font-size:42px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.04em}.ds-price-amount>span{color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6);font-size:12px}.ds-price-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6);margin:7px 0 22px}.ds-price-usage{padding:15px 0;margin:0 0 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--border,#6f6f70);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border,#6f6f70);font-size:11px;display:grid;gap:7px}.ds-price-usage>div{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between}.ds-price-usage dt,.ds-price-usage dd>span{color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6)}.ds-price-usage dd{margin:0;text-align:right;font-weight:500}.ds-price-usage dd>span{font-size:11px;font-weight:400}.ds-price-soon{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;width:100%;min-height:38px;border:1px solid var(--border,#6f6f70);border-radius:6px;padding:8px 12px;font:500 12px/1.5 var(--font-sans,'Inter Variable',Inter,sans-serif);background:var(--secondary,#252527);color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6)}.ds-price-soon:disabled{opacity:1;cursor:not-allowed}.ds-price-details{margin-top:18px}.ds-price-details summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:12px;padding:6px 0;color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6)}.ds-price-details summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-price-details summary svg{transition:transform 140ms ease}.ds-price-details[open] summary svg{transform:rotate(180deg)}.ds-price-details summary:hover{color:var(--foreground,#e8e8e9)}.ds-price-details>div{padding-top:12px}.ds-price-feature-label{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 10px}.ds-price-feature{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6);margin:0 0 20px}.ds-price-approval{padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border,#6f6f70);font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted-foreground,#a1a1a6);margin:0}.ds-price-details summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--trace-accent,#4fb0fe);outline-offset:4px}@container(max-width:680px){.ds-price-description{min-height:0;max-width:none}.ds-price-plan{padding:22px}.ds-price-amount strong{font-size:36px}}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-price-plan{padding:22px}.ds-price-description{min-height:0;max-width:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-price-details summary svg{transition:none}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "affectUI's restrained working surfaces",
    "overview": "The user selected affectUI's flat shell, initial colors and typography. DATUMM builds on that reference with neutral surfaces, hairline separators, compact rounded controls and stronger readable text. Brand expression stays quiet so architectural work and agent responses remain legible.\n\nThis is a code-first record of the built system on 12 November 2026, not a new identity proposal. The workspace is an Operate surface; its composition and authority boundaries live in [the surface contract](docs/ux/surface-contract.md), [PRODUCT.md](PRODUCT.md) and [PLAN.md](PLAN.md). Earlier planning-only status in those historical packets is superseded by the approved implementation recorded in the surface contract.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Neutral tonal layers with restrained semantic color.",
      "Inter typography, compact controls and visible keyboard focus.",
      "User appearance choices remain authoritative."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Readable Color Rule",
        "body": "Runtime appearance resolution adjusts foreground, muted text and semantic text toward the mode's ink until they reach a contrast ratio of at least 4.5 against the three main surfaces; control borders target 3. Hairline separators serve structure and do not replace control boundaries.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use runtime semantic tokens and preserve saved appearance preferences.",
      "**Do** use the self-hosted Inter stack and visible keyboard focus.",
      "**Do** preserve readable wrapping, contained scrolling and labeled state changes.",
      "**Do** keep source, revision and native approval meaning intact while refining presentation."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** copy demo model names, pricing or unavailable service controls from the reference.",
      "**Don't** substitute synthetic panel swatch ramps for runtime palette values.",
      "**Don't** infer Revit approval or verified execution from a visual selection, preview or status color.",
      "**Don't** freeze unverified panel geometry from a screenshot into shared tokens."
    ]
  }
}
